  "body": "## Problem\n\nPR #2192 (#2181) calculates the stock removal before playback. During the calculation the playback worker serves no frame. On the dense face fixture the calculation takes 23.9 s in release. During that time the sheet stands and only the progress line changes.\n\n## Proposal\n\nServe the requested playback frames while the calculation runs. One option: a second field cuts to the playhead while the first field makes the keyframes. Another option: the calculation pauses at each request, serves the frame, and continues.\n\n## Done means\n\n- A test: a frame request during the calculation gets a frame before the calculation ends.\n- The frame is equal to the live cut at that move.\n- The post gate stays unchanged (display only).\n\nFollow-up of #2181.\n",
